{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21948","headline":"感鹤 · 白居易","name":"感鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹤有不羣者，飞飞在野田。\n饥不啄腐鼠，渴不饮盗泉。\n贞姿自耿介，杂鸟何翩翾。\n同游不同志，如此十余年。\n一兴嗜慾念，遂爲矰缴牵。\n委质小池内，争食羣鸡前。\n不惟怀稻粱，兼亦竞腥羶。\n不惟恋主人，兼亦狎鸟鸢。\n物心不可知，天性有时迁。\n一饱尚如此，况乘大夫轩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}